  "title": "Chart alignment: stronger next-bar persistence",
  "summary": "Strictly prior larger-chart alignment improves next-bar colour continuation most consistently in ES and GC. Longer runs are less stable; shared price streams limit independence.",
  "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T23:09:36Z",
