      "kind": "text",
      "id": "methods",
      "title": "Definitions and methods",
      "body": "L counts additional same-colour followers after the small reversal. Larger state must complete strictly before the small signal next-bar-start proxy in the same inferred session; equal-second joins are excluded. Test-labelled rows cover April 13–September 8, 2026, following development August 2024–November 2025 and validation through April 10, 2026. Both directions are the saved combined descriptive cohort. Saved 95% intervals cluster by inferred session; rate differences and their interval bounds are converted from ratios to percentage points without recalculation."
    },
